  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Foulatari Pastoral Wells Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project funds will be used to construct five new wells and rehabilitate one traditional pastoral well. By improving access to adequate supplies of clean water in these communities; the project will contribute to reducing poverty; improving hygiene and health conditions; and mitigating conflict for members of the six communities.</narrative>
  </description>
